# PERF-1 SMK: FOLLOWERS (Steven's issue #3) on the FOLLOW pads. The pad's four voices as drones on the chord: F1 holds the
# key's root (the cadence), F2 and F3 the third and fifth, Common (a note the next chord has stays; otherwise its own tone of
# the chord), F4 a colour. Piece as pedal.amb: A minor, the whole circle (Am Dm G C F Bdim Em Am), its fill playing at once, a bar a chord.
seed 0
wait 3000
# KNOB BANK four times: PERFORM, MIX, CHORDS, NOTES, FOLLOW
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
expect folon 7
# pad 4: the followers on, with F1-F3 (the defaults)
pad 4
wait 200
expect folon 135
# Evolve off for the test (slow, faster, off), so the colour stays the 7th
pad 7
pad 7
# the whole circle: the Progression page's pads (the fills on the bottom row)
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
wait 100
expect view 5
turn K3 -2
pad 12
wait 200
expect prgslot1 4
waitfor chordroot 9 8000
wait 100
# Am: F1 A (A2, in C2 .. B2), F2 C, F3 E
expect padheld0 9
expect padmidi0 45
expect padheld1 0
expect padheld2 4
expect follvl0 >10
waitfor chordroot 2 8000
wait 100
# Dm: F1 holds A; C and E aren't in D F A: F2 to F, F3 to A
expect padheld0 9
expect padheld1 5
expect padheld2 9
waitfor chordroot 7 8000
wait 100
# G: F1 still A; F and A aren't in G B D: B and D
expect padheld0 9
expect padheld1 11
expect padheld2 2
shot follow_prog.png
waitfor chordroot 0 8000
wait 100
# C: B and D aren't in C E G: E and G
expect padheld1 4
expect padheld2 7
# back to Perform: the FOLLOW pads again. F4 on, colour 7th: over F, E
tap HOME
wait 200
expect view 0
pad 3
wait 200
expect folon 143
expect folcol 1
waitfor chordroot 5 8000
wait 100
expect padheld3 4
expect padheld0 9
# F1 follows the chords' roots instead (pad 12 on the second page): F; and back to the key's A
sbtn RIGHT
pad 12
wait 200
expect padheld0 5
pad 12
wait 200
expect padheld0 9
# off: the pad breathes again on the chord, in its own register
sbtn LEFT
pad 4
wait 200
expect folon 15
expect padmidi0 >47
# a piece's own: on again, another piece has the defaults (off), back here they are as left
pad 4
wait 200
expect folon 143
turn PRESET 1
wait 1500
expect piece 1
expect folon 7
turn PRESET -1
wait 1500
expect piece 0
expect folon 143
# saved with the piece (GLO, SAVE): there after a power-on
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 1
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect piece 0
expect folon 143
expect padheld0 9
